          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1453,
          "content": "<!-- TagList organism for VEDO Core. GitLab-like tags management.\n     Components:\n     - Header with title, tag count, and New tag button\n     - Search input for filtering tags\n     - Table with columns: Tag name (with copy), Commit (SHA + message), Description, Last update, Actions\n     - Actions: download source, delete tag (with confirm dialog)\n     - Pagination\n     - Empty and loading states\n     Used in frames: Versioning & Collaboration (Tags tab).\n-->",
